# Every exercise's solution (scripts/gen_all_results.py) — includes the
# two tiers the app itself never reveals a solution for (professional/
# genius), kept out of the repo on purpose, not just out of the UI; see
# server/exercises.py's list_exercises() for the corresponding API-side
# redaction. private_solutions.json is the underlying vault
# gen_all_results.py renders this from for those two tiers, once their
# own exercises/*.json no longer carries ideal_keystrokes at all.
all_results.md
private_solutions.json

# Deployment
# .env holds machine-specific overrides (see .env.example, which IS
# committed, for what's available) — never the same across deployments,
# so never one to commit.
.env
